  "question": {
    "text": "A fair coin is tossed repeatedly until two consecutive heads are obtained. If the probability that <math><mn>2</mn></math> consecutive heads occur on fourth and fifth toss is&nbsp;<math><mi>p</mi></math>, then <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
